sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant Browser
    participant Nginx
    participant Backend as Django REST API
    participant TopicViewSet
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Student->>Browser: Clicks "Apply for topic"
    Browser->>Nginx: POST /api/topics/{id}/apply/
    Nginx->>Backend: Proxy API request
    Backend->>TopicViewSet: apply(request, pk)

    TopicViewSet->>DB: Load topic with select_for_update
    DB-->>TopicViewSet: Topic

    TopicViewSet->>DB: Load student profile
    DB-->>TopicViewSet: StudentProfile

    TopicViewSet->>DB: Check active applications
    DB-->>TopicViewSet: Application count

    alt Topic is unavailable
        TopicViewSet-->>Backend: 400 Bad Request
        Backend-->>Nginx: Error response
        Nginx-->>Browser: Error response
    else Course does not match topic type
        TopicViewSet-->>Backend: 400 Bad Request or 404 Not Found
        Backend-->>Nginx: Error response
        Nginx-->>Browser: Error response
    else Student already has active application
        TopicViewSet-->>Backend: 400 Bad Request
        Backend-->>Nginx: Error response
        Nginx-->>Browser: Error response
    else Application is valid
        TopicViewSet->>DB: Create TopicApplication with pending status
        TopicViewSet->>DB: Update Topic status to pending_approval
        DB-->>TopicViewSet: Saved
        TopicViewSet-->>Backend: 200 OK
        Backend-->>Nginx: JSON response
        Nginx-->>Browser: JSON response
    end